# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# env file
.env

# Editor/IDE
# Note: `.idea/*` (not `.idea/`) so the negation below can re-include
# specific subpaths. Git refuses to descend into a fully-ignored
# directory, which would otherwise drop the carve-out.
.idea/*
# Shared GoLand/IntelliJ run + debug configurations (see
# docs/contributor/goland-debugging.md). Per-user state in
# .idea/workspace.xml stays ignored.
!.idea/runConfigurations/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# Build output
/bin/
# goreleaser output
/dist/
/out/
# Root-level binaries produced by `go build ./cmd/...`.
# The leading slash is essential — without it, these patterns also
# ignore `cmd/openccu-loom/` and `cmd/hmcli/` (which contain main.go).
/openccu-loom
/openccu-loom-*
/hmcli

# Generated sources (committed separately when stable)
*_generated.go.bak

# Local state directories (dev / integration runs). Unanchored var/:
# test runs also drop state dirs next to the package under test
# (e.g. cmd/openccu-loom/var/); no tracked file lives in any var/.
var/
/state/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
secrets.key
# Auto-generated master key for at-rest secret encryption (ADR 0027).
secret.key

# TLS + backup artifacts (never commit)
tls/
backup/
*.sbk
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
# Embedded CCU-data archives are intentionally committed — they are
# synced from openccu-data and ship inside the binary (see
# docs/adr/0003-embed-occu-extracts.md).
!internal/ccudata/embedded/*.gz
!internal/ccudata/embedded/profiles/
!internal/ccudata/embedded/profiles/*.gz
!internal/ccudata/embedded/profiles/*.json
!internal/ccudata/embedded/translation_custom/
!internal/ccudata/embedded/translation_custom/*.json

# Svelte SPA build output. Keep the placeholder .gitkeep checked in so
# `go build` (//go:embed all:spa_dist) works in a fresh clone without
# requiring Node/npm. The release workflow builds the real SPA into this
# directory and restores .gitkeep afterwards so the tree stays clean.
/internal/north/ui/spa_dist/*
!/internal/north/ui/spa_dist/.gitkeep

# goreleaser release-notes scratch file, generated from CHANGELOG.md in
# the release workflow. Untracked → would otherwise make the tree dirty.
/RELEASE_NOTES.md

# Session recorder output (runtime only — keep tests/golden/sessions/
# committed, so the pattern must not be root-free).
/var/sessions/

# Logs
logs/
*.log

# pprof output
*.pprof
*.prof

# Coverage / test artifacts
/coverage/
coverage.html

# Local config overrides (users shouldn't commit these)
openccu-loom.local.yaml
config.local.yaml

# macOS
.DS_Store

/config.yaml

/tmp

# Generated by tests/integration/model_snapshot_test.go and
# script/aiohomematic_snapshot.py — these run on demand and produce
# 60+ MB JSON. Not version-controlled.
tests/integration/testdata/model_snapshot_openccu-loom.json
tests/integration/testdata/model_snapshot_aiohomematic.json
# Generated by tests/integration/discovery_snapshot_test.go +
# script/homematicip_local_snapshot.py +
# script/aiohomematic2mqtt_discovery_snapshot.py — same on-demand
# pattern, multi-MB JSON. homematicip_local is the primary reference,
# aiohomematic2mqtt is the secondary cross-check.
tests/integration/testdata/discovery_snapshot_openccu-loom.json
tests/integration/testdata/discovery_snapshot_homematicip_local.json
tests/integration/testdata/discovery_snapshot_aiohomematic2mqtt.json
/script/__pycache__
/aiohomematic_storage

# Stray reachability binary (regenerable via 'make reachability').
# Anchored to the repo root so it does NOT match the script/reachability/
# source package — a bare 'reachability' pattern hides that directory.
/reachability


# Generated SBOM (run 'make sbom' / CI release artifact)
/sbom.json

# MkDocs build output
site/
__pycache__/
*-read-only.env
test-results/
.ccu_cred
